#!/usr/bin/env python3
# GENERATED by plugin-cursor/scripts/compose.sh — edit plugin/ then re-compose
"""Evidence Contract loader + Execution Envelope renderer for synaptory hooks.

Single machine-readable source of truth for the receipt / DoD / replay
contracts that previously lived only as scattered constants in
story_pipeline.py (DOD_CHECKS, DOD_TIER_CHECKS, _evaluate_check),
verification_runner.py (VERIFICATION_ALLOWLIST, shell-control token refusals,
timeouts) and receipt_validator.py (required fields, VALID_V3_STAGES,
role/backend enums). See issue #163 (WP1 of the #134 remediation program).

The canonical JSON artifact ships at plugin/receipt-schema/evidence-contract.json;
EMBEDDED_DEFAULTS below is content-equivalent (a drift test enforces equality)
so consumers keep working when the file is absent (e.g. partial installs).
The signed policy cache (~/.synaptory/.cache/policy.json → payload.receipt_schema)
overlays required_fields / valid_roles / valid_backends, mirroring
receipt_validator._load_policy_schema.

CLI:
    python3 evidence_contract.py envelope --agent-type synaptory:software-engineer \
        [--active-checks tests_pass,build_succeeds] [--tier growing]
    python3 evidence_contract.py explain <code>
    python3 evidence_contract.py dump
"""

